[ash@pawl.rpi.edu (Arthur Hyun) writes:]
[] Anyhow, though, what is the Wizard Mode for?
[] I know you can check your luck, alignment, and intrinsics, force your
[] god &c, but is there any specific purpose?

wizard-mode _is_ a misnomer in nethack.  it would be better called
debug-mode.  it's purpose is to give you an oppurtunity to play the
game with the ability to make things happen so's you can see what
goes wrong, where, when, why and how.  of course, you can also learn
a lot about the game by playing this way.

[] What's this stuff about linking bones?

computerese.  i think the question is "Unlink bones?" which only occurs
in wizard/debug-mode.  it means you got bones and you have the option
of not keeping them on disk.  a "no" response means don't delete the
bones file (perhaps to save them for future testing, etc.).

